Version 0.1.0 (unreleased)

  * First release.

  * Windows module (iw4x-steam64.dll) for the 64-bit Steam client, loaded by
    the game through the rundll32 attach entry point.

  * Linux module (libiw4x-steam.so) for the 32-bit native Steam client, with
    the iw4x-steam launcher that preloads it, for the game running under
    Proton.

  * Rewriting of the GamesPlayed reports of registered IW4x processes, so
    that friends see IW4x under an app the account owns, and resending of a
    report that Steam sent before the game registered.
